{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 10270249205848170200,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Spatial and Temporal Dimensions",
      "source_hash": 6309161411835877832,
      "context_hash": 8603519247815921085,
      "translation": "공간 차원과 시간 차원",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Spatial and Temporal Dimensions": "공간 차원과 시간 차원",
        "dimensions": "차원"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:18.307474Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`HostTensor<D, E>` uses a single mapping to fully capture its physical representation.",
      "source_hash": 7495024918867987249,
      "context_hash": 2702999386084131195,
      "translation": "`HostTensor<D, E>`는 단일 매핑으로 물리적 표현을 완전히 담아냅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "mapping": "매핑"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:18.307475Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Device tensors split their mapping across multiple dedicated dimensions:",
      "source_hash": 6931481831644115796,
      "context_hash": 7719949522500137048,
      "translation": "디바이스 텐서는 매핑을 여러 전용 차원에 분할합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "dimensions": "차원",
        "mapping": "매핑"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:18.307476Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**Spatial dimensions**: `Chip`, `Cluster`, and `Slice` distribute data across the hardware hierarchy.",
      "source_hash": 11089697268786585409,
      "context_hash": 13554020880855981794,
      "translation": "**공간 차원**: `Chip`, `Cluster`, `Slice`는 데이터를 하드웨어 계층에 분산시킵니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "dimensions": "차원"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:18.307476Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "In stream tensors, `Packet` additionally sizes parallel delivery within each temporal iteration.",
      "source_hash": 197877853764119523,
      "context_hash": 13078493361940483428,
      "translation": "스트림 텐서에서는 `Packet`이 각 시간적 반복 내의 병렬 전달 크기를 추가로 결정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:18.307476Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**Temporal dimension**: `Time` sequences the delivery iterations in stream tensors.",
      "source_hash": 2656115517564354835,
      "context_hash": 12826254001166958154,
      "translation": "**시간 차원**: `Time`은 스트림 텐서에서 전달 반복의 순서를 지정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "dimension": "차원"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:18.307477Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Spatial Dimensions",
      "source_hash": 13481639118001035424,
      "context_hash": 8879851914609634081,
      "translation": "공간 차원",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "dimensions": "차원"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:18.307477Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Each spatial level in the hardware hierarchy gets its own type parameter in the tensor type, enabling spatial parallelism.",
      "source_hash": 14150796554544541264,
      "context_hash": 6746831160830065636,
      "translation": "하드웨어 계층의 각 공간 레벨은 텐서 타입에서 자신만의 타입 매개변수를 가지며, 이를 통해 공간적 병렬성이 가능해집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:18.307477Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "All units at each level are assumed to share the same mapping.",
      "source_hash": 7928074058672130972,
      "context_hash": 1182855006926164361,
      "translation": "각 레벨의 모든 유닛은 동일한 매핑을 공유하는 것으로 가정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "mapping": "매핑"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:18.307477Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The notation below names physical dimensions but is not a public type or constructor.",
      "source_hash": 8572312801988800649,
      "context_hash": 10078362667174911962,
      "translation": "아래 표기법은 물리적 차원의 이름을 나타내지만 공개 타입이나 생성자는 아닙니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "dimensions": "차원"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:18.307478Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "The storage modules document the public tensor APIs and views.",
      "source_hash": 13371327939975124421,
      "context_hash": 5641864936421069149,
      "translation": "스토리지 모듈은 공개 텐서 API와 뷰를 문서화합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:18.307478Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "HBM tensors distribute data across chips for spatial parallelism: each chip processes its own portion of the data simultaneously.",
      "source_hash": 2689760152617874459,
      "context_hash": 5698136768908459645,
      "translation": "HBM 텐서는 공간적 병렬성을 위해 Chip들에 걸쳐 데이터를 분산합니다. 각 Chip은 자신의 데이터 일부를 동시에 처리합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Chip": "Chip"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:18.307478Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "For example, `HbmTensor<bf16, m![A], m![B]>` distributes `8 × 512 = 4096` elements across 8 chips with 512 elements per chip.",
      "source_hash": 10577619363893985745,
      "context_hash": 7518070637063033677,
      "translation": "예를 들어, `HbmTensor<bf16, m![A], m![B]>`는 Chip당 512개의 요소로 8개의 Chip에 걸쳐 `8 × 512 = 4096`개의 요소를 분산합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Chip": "Chip",
        "elements": "요소"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:18.307478Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:2",
      "source": "The `i`-th chip's `j`-th element stores tensor index `i![A: i, B: j]`.",
      "source_hash": 4619446194299050957,
      "context_hash": 15917535236279221308,
      "translation": "`i`번째 Chip의 `j`번째 요소는 텐서 인덱스 `i![A: i, B: j]`를 저장합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "element": "요소",
        "Chip": "Chip"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:18.307479Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "SRAM tensor types add `Cluster` and `Slice` dimensions for finer-grained parallelism. `TrfTensor` additionally has a `Lane` dimension that distributes TRF data across the 8 lanes per slice.",
      "source_hash": 10605102739855547337,
      "context_hash": 17663952628157376028,
      "translation": "SRAM 텐서 타입은 더 세밀한 병렬성을 위해 `Cluster`와 `Slice` 차원을 추가합니다. `TrfTensor`는 추가로 `Lane` 차원을 가지며, 이는 TRF 데이터를 슬라이스당 8개의 레인에 분산시킵니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "dimensions": "차원",
        "Slice": "Slice",
        "dimension": "차원"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:18.307479Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "See [Contraction Engine](../computing-tensors/contraction-engine/index.md) for details.",
      "source_hash": 9952168931645575477,
      "context_hash": 191806483618399155,
      "translation": "자세한 내용은 [Contraction Engine](../computing-tensors/contraction-engine/index.md)을 참조하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Contraction Engine": "Contraction Engine"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:18.307480Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "HBM tensors carry concrete addresses.",
      "source_hash": 773588289412610973,
      "context_hash": 17704926952374765557,
      "translation": "HBM 텐서는 구체적인 주소를 가집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:18.307480Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:1",
      "source": "DM, TRF, and VRF tensors may receive addresses from the backend.",
      "source_hash": 6101885070920655206,
      "context_hash": 11296029807803287623,
      "translation": "DM, TRF, VRF 텐서는 백엔드로부터 주소를 받을 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DM": "DM"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:18.307480Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:2",
      "source": "Host tensors remain host-side values.",
      "source_hash": 4174107741832294823,
      "context_hash": 17087047792039265869,
      "translation": "호스트 텐서는 호스트 측 값으로 남아 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:18.307480Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:3",
      "source": "Mapping parameters determine physical representation; storage owns addresses separately.",
      "source_hash": 13033496769393775648,
      "context_hash": 10315037969426776911,
      "translation": "매핑 매개변수는 물리적 표현을 결정하며, 스토리지는 주소를 별도로 소유합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "mapping": "매핑"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:18.307480Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Constraints",
      "source_hash": 11930884711566436492,
      "context_hash": 14720025170843849786,
      "translation": "제약 조건",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "constraints": "제약 조건"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:18.307480Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "**`Chip`, `Cluster`, and `Slice` size**: they must exactly match the hardware counts:",
      "source_hash": 16351896945771935318,
      "context_hash": 9276799150318350502,
      "translation": "**`Chip`, `Cluster`, `Slice`의 크기**: 이들은 하드웨어 개수와 정확히 일치해야 합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:43:18.307481Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
