    {
      "id": "section:1/block:25/seg:0",
      "source": "Any dimension can be padded with `#` when the kernel uses fewer units than the hardware provides.",
      "source_hash": 11859532585676963051,
      "context_hash": 11427371698797890513,
      "translation": "커널이 하드웨어가 제공하는 것보다 적은 수의 유닛을 사용하는 경우, 어떤 차원이든 `#`으로 패딩할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "padded": "패딩",
        "dimension": "차원"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:42:50.325452Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:25/seg:1",
      "source": "For example, `type Cluster = m![1 # 2]` uses 1 active cluster and 1 padding-only cluster, satisfying the hardware's 2-cluster-per-chip requirement.",
      "source_hash": 13782295418244908669,
      "context_hash": 8046554174306362121,
      "translation": "예를 들어, `type Cluster = m![1 # 2]`는 활성 Cluster 1개와 패딩 전용 Cluster 1개를 사용하여, 하드웨어의 Chip당 2개 Cluster 요구 사항을 충족합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Chip": "Chip",
        "padding": "패딩",
        "Cluster": "Cluster"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:42:50.325453Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:26/seg:0",
      "source": "[!NOTE] The runtime operates at chip granularity (`#[device(chip = N)]`), so partial chip or cluster usage is not yet supported.",
      "source_hash": 2271290917732595053,
      "context_hash": 5930680331782717710,
      "translation": "[!NOTE] 런타임은 칩 단위(`#[device(chip = N)]`)로 동작하므로, 부분적인 칩 또는 cluster 사용은 아직 지원되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Chip": "Chip",
        "Cluster": "Cluster"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:42:50.325454Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:26/seg:1",
      "source": "This may be relaxed in future releases.",
      "source_hash": 16165403544778797259,
      "context_hash": 9477441679223734123,
      "translation": "이는 향후 릴리스에서 완화될 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:42:50.325456Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:27/seg:0",
      "source": "**`Element` size**: `Element::SIZE * size_of::<D>()` must not exceed the per-unit SRAM capacity, which varies by tensor type:",
      "source_hash": 9222471137061812867,
      "context_hash": 7698467666763110732,
      "translation": "**`Element` 크기**: `Element::SIZE * size_of::<D>()`는 유닛당 SRAM 용량을 초과해서는 안 되며, 이는 텐서 타입에 따라 다릅니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T18:42:50.325456Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:28/seg:0",
      "source": "Type",
      "source_hash": 1769059670591154792,
      "context_hash": 14200799013993565671,
      "translation": "타입",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:03:08.822810Z",
      "issues": []
